| `/human_reviews/PacBhLzeGO.md` (DCPT) | 6.25 | Universal restoration but less novel evaluation framework. PRISM has stronger contributions in scientific utility. |
| `/human_reviews/6t8SUcA4sI.md` (Ratio-Residual) | 5.33 | Medium anchor; narrower scope, mathematical issues. PRISM is more novel and broader. |
| `/human_reviews/19QWQSsbOA.md` (Microscopy diffusion) | 5.00 | Medium anchor; domain-specific, weaker evaluation. PRISM considerably more thorough. |
