| VIBeID (biometric gait dataset, 100 subjects, comprehensive benchmarks, unclear protocol) | `2d734s2WDb.md` | 5.75 | Stronger than VIBEFACE: twice as many subjects, multi-task benchmark, clearer evaluation; VIBeID still got rejected |
| Eye Fairness (30k-subject fairness dataset with methodology issues) | `Lv9KZ5qCSG.md` | 5.50 | Much larger scale; VIBEFACE is significantly weaker in statistical support for fairness claims |
