| `bsr78Cj2H7.md` (Gradient-free variational learning with CMNs) | 4.00, Rejected | Applying conjugate CAVI to a new model class for gradient-free inference; criticized for weak baselines and limited scope. VBGS has stronger empirical breadth but shares the baseline gap issue. |
| `IcPkW3QNW2.md` (DepthSplat) | 5.00, Withdrawn | 3DGS + depth interaction paper with borderline reviews; depth as an advantage is central, as here. |
| `SSE9myD9SG.md` (3D Vision-Language Gaussian Splatting) | 6.40, Accepted | Accepted 3DGS paper with genuine novel component; stronger in demonstrating advantage over proper baselines. |
